00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:19.400
Each week, we will break down an episode of The Office and give exclusive behind-the-scenes stories that only two people who were there can tell you.
每周，我们都会深度解析一集《办公室》，并分享只有身临其境的我们两人才能告诉你的独家幕后故事。

7
00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:20.560
We're The Office Ladies.
我们是“办公室女士”。

8
00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:26.310
Lady!
女士！

9
00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:29.270
We're not in the studio together today, are we?
我们今天没在同一个录音室，对吧？

10
00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:30.550
We're not.
是的，没在一起。

11
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:32.810
